  "stop_conditions": [
    "Return BLOCKED on any subject fingerprint, active-dispatch exclusion, selected-handoff, branch/HEAD, or authority mismatch.",
    "Return CHANGES_REQUIRED if correctness requires broader resolver redesign, a high-level CRITICAL symbol edit, package/Cargo changes, per-kind dispatch, ambient authority, weakened repository safety, HCM-2.2 reinterpretation, or later-phase work; identify the conflict rather than widening scope.",
    "Return CHANGES_REQUIRED on any untested mandatory vector, partial persistence authority, unsafe filesystem access, stale or overly broad classification, manifest omission/self-reference, or unsupported proof claim.",
    "Do not waive or repair findings and do not create a global handoff."
  ],
